    Use INVALID_DISPLAY as the default displayId for the trackball
    
    As we know, trackball events are dispatched based on the focused
    window. In a multi-display environment, if display #0 is not focused,
    and we still specify the target display as display #0, it may lead to
    unexpected ANR. Here, we will default the displayId of trackball events
    to #-1, allowing the InputDispatcher to determine the specific target
    display for dispatching.
    
    Bug: 368378837
    Test: Build
    
    Change-Id: I60c8f615e07a1874b15760081ff178376b79e6ec
    Signed-off-by: Linnan Li <lilinnan@xiaomi.corp-partner.google.com>

