Date:   Thu Sep 5 17:00:29 2024 +0000

    Preserve Cargo.lock when running cargo_embargo.
    
    cargo_embargo will respect a Cargo.lock file if one is present in the
    vendored code.
    
    If not, it will create one, which we have been preserving and checking
    in, leading to unintended and unhelpful churn.
    
    This change ensures that any existing Cargo.lock files in vendored code
    are preserved, but no new Cargo.lock files are introduced.
    
    Change-Id: Iee69e214484faba596995e8e1b813b7ae74fd7d8
    Bug: 339424309
    Test: treehugger

