    Winscope: Update TransformMatrix labels to to match platform code
    
    The labels used for different coefficients within the TransformMatrix
    class used in Winscope do not match the labels for those values from the
    platform. In this CL, we update Winscope's use of these labels to match
    the labels in the platform. Functionally, there should be no behavior
    change to the Winscope UI/tool.
    
    This is needed because the transform coefficients were written incorrectly from
    the platform initially. Since then, a new method to write the transform values
    correctly has been introduced, but it can be only used for newly added
    transforms to ensure backwards compatibility.
    
    To account for this, we adjust the transform node directly to correct
    labels in the cases where we know the transform was written
    incorrectly.
    
    Bug: 332714237
    Bug: 210460522
    Test: Presubmit
    Flag: EXEMPT dev tool only
    Change-Id: I82dd59184ae35db7357f4b6e47bad36531a8c6f7

