    Fix Transitions viewer slow loading
    
    The viewer used to perform very slow O(n) operations, which were
    potentially triggered for each trace position update.
    
    This commit:
    - precomputes the O(n) operations and caches the result during viewer's initialization.
    - uses the CustomQuery API to speed up the O(n) operations
    
    Fix: 300475062
    Test: load bugreport in b/300309899#comment2, switch betweek Transitions and SF tabs, \
       make sure winscope doesn't freeze anymore.
    Change-Id: Iaea6c4fa1533bef7659412259c087740c05817a3

