Author: Kean Mariotti <keanmariotti@google.com>
Date:   Tue Oct 24 10:21:52 2023 +0000

    Extend Trace API with "custom query"
    
    - Add Trace#customQuery() to allow defining specialized queries
      that retrieve custom trace data (other than full trace entries).
    - Remove Trace#prefetchPartialProtos() (replaced by custom queries).
    - Introduce TraceEntryLazy and TraceEntryEager to clearly communicate
      whether data is lazily or eagerly fetched.
    - Add VisitableParserCustomQuery to minimize boiler plate in parsers.
    - Add CustomQueryType.VSYNCID, which replaces Trace#prefetchPartialProtos().
    - Add CustomQueryType.SF_LAYERS_ID_AND_NAME, to optimize the Transitions viewer.
    - Add CustomQueryType.WM_WINDOWS_TOKEN_AND_TITLE, to optimize the Transitions viewer.
    - Add parsers/perfetto/utils.ts to factor out (de-duplicate) query logic.
    
    Fix: 291213403
    Test: npm run test:presubmit
    Change-Id: Ibaa39ac56d5140df973aa19ea65e42ca59e83576

