    Unify DiffGenerator with flicker objects
    
    Previously the DiffGenerator on flicker used an independent structure.
    This was necessary because iwnscope used flicker objects for WM and its
    own objects for SF traces.
    
    Now that both traces use flicker objects this is no longer necessary, so
    remove this code to simplify the codebase and improve performance
    
    Also, remove unused code from transform_sf because the objects are now
    entirely parsed thorugh flicker and no operations are necessary in
    winscope
    
    Finally, fix eslint issues on the files (camel case, lack of semicolon,
    unused variables) to improve readability
    
